eb de Apple II Programs Jekyll","Uso de Jekyll para la creación de contenido"],"fr":["Créer des publications de programmes avec code source et captures d''écran","Créer des articles de blog pour des mises à jour générales ou des annonces","Sélection du type de contenu : programme ou article de blog","Configuration du titre et de la date pour le contenu","Compatibilité avec le site web Apple II Programs Jekyll","Utilisation de Jekyll pour la création de contenu"],"de":["Erstellen von Programmbeiträgen mit Quellcode und Screenshots","Erstellen von Blogbeiträgen für allgemeine Updates oder Ankündigungen","Auswahl des InhaltsTyps: Programm oder Blogbeitrag","Konfiguration von Titel und Datum für den Inhalt","Kompatibilität mit der Apple II Programs Jekyll-Website","Verwendung von Jekyll für die Erstellung von Inhalt"],"pt":["Criação de posts de programas com código-fonte, screenshot e descrição","Criação de posts de blogs para atualizações gerais, anúncios ou artigos","Configuração rápida com perguntas sobre tipo, título e data","Suporte ao site Apple II Programs Jekyll","Tipos de conteúdo: Program Post e Blog Post","Uso de Jekyll para gerar sites estáticos"],"ru":["Создание программных постов с исходным кодом, скриншотом и описанием","Создание блог-постов для общих обновлений, объявлений или статей","Быстрая настройка с вопросами о типе, названии и дате","Поддержка сайта Apple II Programs Jekyll","Типы контента: Program Post и Blog Post","Использование Jekyll для генерации статических сайтов"],"ar":["إنشاء منشورات برامج مع شفرة المصدر و لقطة الشاشة و وصف","إنشاء منشورات مدونات للتحديثات العامة أو الإعلانات أو المقالات","إعداد سريع مع أسئلة حول النوع و العنوان و التاريخ","دعم موقع Apple II Programs Jekyll","أنواع المحتوى: منشور برنامج و منشور مدونة","استخدام Jekyll لإنشاء مواقع ثابتة"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use new-content","new-content setup guide","Jekyll site content creation","Applesoft BASIC program posts","new-content alternative","new-content vs Jekyll plugins","what is new-content","new-content install","creating blog posts with new-content"],"zh":["新内容技能","Apple II 程序帖子","博客帖子创建","Jekyll站点","AI工具","程序帖子创建","源代码截图","快速开始创建新内容"],"ja":["新規コンテンツスキル","Apple IIプログラム投稿","ブログ投稿作成","Jekyllサイト","AIエージェント","プログラム投稿作成","ソースコードスクリーンショット","新規コンテンツの作成方法"],"ko":["새 콘텐츠 기능","Apple II 프로그램 게시물","블로그 게시물 생성","Jekyll 사이트","인공지능 툴","프로그램 게시물 생성","소스 코드 스크린샷","새 콘텐츠 생성 방법"],"es":["creación de contenido","desarrollo web","Apple II Programs Jekyll","publicaciones de programas","artículos de blog","Jekyll","desarrolladores","herramientas de inteligencia artificial","guía de configuración"],"fr":["création de contenu","développement web","Apple II Programs Jekyll","publications de programmes","articles de blog","Jekyll","développeurs","outils d''intelligence artificielle","guide de configuration"],"de":["Erstellung von Inhalt","Webentwicklung","Apple II Programs Jekyll","Programmbeiträge","Blogbeiträge","Jekyll","Entwickler","KI-Tools","Konfigurationsleitfaden"],"pt":["novo conteúdo","Apple II","Jekyll","posts de programas","posts de blogs","criação de conteúdo","configuração rápida","tipos de conteúdo","desenvolvimento web","geração de sites estáticos"],"ru":["новый контент","Apple II","Jekyll","программные посты","блог-посты","создание контента","быстрая настройка","типы контента","веб-разработка","генерация статических сайтов"],"ar":["محتوى جديد","Apple II","Jekyll","منشورات برامج","منشورات مدونات","إنشاء محتوى","إعداد سريع","أنواع المحتوى","تطوير الويب","إنشاء مواقع ثابتة"]}},"owner":"thelbane","repo":"Apple-II-Programs","repoPath":"thelbane/Apple-II-Programs","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.441Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"new-content","description":"Create new Apple II program posts or blog posts for this Jekyll site. Use when the user wants to add a new program, start a new post, create content, or asks about adding programs or blog entries.","bodyPreview":"# Creating New Content\n\nThis skill guides you through creating new program posts or blog posts for the Apple II Programs Jekyll site.\n\n## Content Types\n\n**Program Post**: Showcases an Apple II Applesoft BASIC program with source code, screenshot, and description.\n\n**Blog Post**: General updates, announcements, or articles about the site or Apple II topics.\n\n## Quick Start\n\nAsk the user:\n1. **Type**: Program or blog post?\n2. **Title**: What should it be called?\n3. **Date**: Use today''s date or a","body":"# Creating New Content\n\nThis skill guides you through creating new program posts or blog posts for the Apple II Programs Jekyll site.\n\n## Content Types\n\n**Program Post**: Showcases an Apple II Applesoft BASIC program with source code, screenshot, and description.\n\n**Blog Post**: General updates, announcements, or articles about the site or Apple II topics.\n\n## Quick Start\n\nAsk the user:\n1. **Type**: Program or blog post?\n2. **Title**: What should it be called?\n3. **Date**: Use today''s date or a specific date?\n\nFor programs, also ask:\n4. **Program type**: One-liner or two-liner?\n5. **Performance**: Runs OK at 1MHz or slow?\n6. **Source code**: Provide the Applesoft BASIC code\n\n---\n\n## Creating a Program Post\n\n### Required Files\n\n| File | Location | Purpose |\n|------|----------|---------|\n| Post | `docs/programs/_posts/YYYY-MM-DD-slug.md` | Main post file |\n| Source | `docs/_includes/src/slug.txt` | Applesoft source code |\n| Screenshot | `docs/media/slug.png` or `.gif` or `.jpg` | Full-size image |\n| Thumbnail | `docs/media/slug-tn.png` | Thumbnail (smaller version) |\n\n### Post Template\n\n```markdown\n---\nlayout: post\ntitle: Program Title\ndate: YYYY-MM-DD\ndescription: Brief description of the program\ntags: program one-liner 1mhz-ok\nauthor: Lee Fastenau\nscreenshot: /media/slug.png\nthumbnail: /media/slug-tn.png\nsource: /src/slug.txt\ndiscussion:\n    -\n        name: Discussion Link Name\n        url: https://example.com/link\n---\n\nDescription of the program and any usage instructions.\n```\n\n### Tag Options\n\n| Tag | Description |\n|-----|-------------|\n| `program` | **Required** for all programs |\n| `one-liner` | Program fits on one line |\n| `two-liner` | Program fits on two lines |\n| `1mhz-ok` | Runs well on 1MHz Apple II |\n| `1mhz-slow` | Runs slow on 1MHz (triggers warp mode in emulator) |\n| `notable` | Featured/award-winning program |\n| `monochrome` | Best viewed in monochrome mode |\n\n### Source File Format\n\nCreate `docs/_includes/src/slug.txt` with the raw Applesoft code. Each logical line should be on its own line:\n\n```\n0HGR2:FORN=1TO100:HCOLOR=RND(1)*7+1:HPLOTX,Y:NEXT\n```\n\nFor two-liners, use two lines:\n\n```\n0FIRST LINE OF CODE HERE\n1SECOND LINE OF CODE HERE\n```\n\n---\n\n## Creating a Blog Post\n\n### Post Template\n\n```markdown\n---\nlayout: post\ntitle: Post Title\ndate: YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS -0700\ntags: updates\nauthor: Lee Fastenau\n---\n\nBlog post content here.\n\nUse `<!--more-->` to create an excerpt break.\n```\n\n### Common Blog Tags\n\n- `updates` - Site updates and announcements\n- `emulation` - Emulator-related content\n\n### Including Images\n\nUse the img include:\n\n```liquid\n{% include img.html src=\"/assets/images/post/image-name.png\" caption=\"Image caption\" alt=\"Alt text description\" %}\n```\n\n### Including Code Snippets\n\nUse the applesoft include:\n\n```liquid\n{% capture source_code -%}\n0YOUR CODE HERE\n{%- endcapture %}{% include applesoft.md src=source_code %}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Naming Conventions\n\n- **Slug**: Lowercase, hyphen-separated (e.g., `my-program-name`)\n- **Date format**: `YYYY-MM-DD` or `YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS -0700` for specific times\n- **Filename**: `YYYY-MM-DD-slug.md`\n\n## Media Guidelines\n\n- **Screenshots**: Use PNG for static, GIF for animated, JPG for photos\n- **Thumbnails**: Should be `-tn.png` suffix, smaller version of screenshot\n- Place all media in `docs/media/`\n\n---\n\n## Checklist\n\n### Program Post\n\n- [ ] Create post file: `docs/programs/_posts/YYYY-MM-DD-slug.md`\n- [ ] Create source file: `docs/_includes/src/slug.txt`\n- [ ] Add screenshot: `docs/media/slug.png|gif|jpg`\n- [ ] Add thumbnail: `docs/media/slug-tn.png`\n- [ ] Frontmatter includes: layout, title, date, description, tags, author, screenshot, thumbnail, source\n- [ ] Tags include `program` plus line count and performance tags\n\n### Blog Post\n\n- [ ] Create post file: `docs/_posts/YYYY-MM-DD-slug.md`\n- [ ] Frontmatter includes: layout, title, date, tags, author\n- [ ] Add images to `docs/assets/images/post/` if needed\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:07:44.681Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Content Creation Agents needing to generate Applesoft BASIC program posts with source code, screenshots, and descriptions for the Apple II Programs Jekyll site.","zh":"非常适合需要生成包含源代码、屏幕截图和描述的Applesoft BASIC程序帖子的内容创作代理，用于Apple II Programs Jekyll站点。","ja":"Applesoft BASICプログラムの投稿を生成するためにソースコード、スクリーンショット、説明を含むコンテンツ作成エージェントに最適です。Apple II Programs Jekyllサイト用。","ko":"소스 코드, 스크린샷, 설명을 포함하는 Applesoft BASIC 프로그램 포스트를 생성해야 하는 콘텐츠 생성 에이전트에게 적합합니다. Apple II Programs Jekyll 사이트용.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Creación de Contenido que necesitan generar publicaciones de programas Applesoft BASIC con código fuente, capturas de pantalla y descripciones para el sitio Jekyll de Programas Apple II.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Création de Contenu ayant besoin de générer des publications de programmes Applesoft BASIC avec code source, captures d''écran et descriptions pour le site Jekyll de Programmes Apple II.","de":"Perfekt für Content-Erstellung-Agenten, die Applesoft BASIC-Programm-Beiträge mit Quellcode, Screenshots und Beschreibungen für die Apple II-Programme Jekyll-Website erstellen müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Criação de Conteúdo que precisam gerar posts de programas em Applesoft BASIC com código-fonte, capturas de tela e descrições para o site Apple II Programs Jekyll.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по созданию контента, которым необходимо создавать посты программ Applesoft BASIC с исходным кодом, скриншотами и описаниями для сайта Apple II Programs Jekyll.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء منشورات برامج Applesoft BASIC مع شفرة المصدر والصور الشاشة والوصف لموقع Apple II Programs Jekyll."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create new program posts or blog posts with features like content type selection, title specification, and date setting, utilizing Jekyll site compatibility and Applesoft BASIC source code integration.","zh":"赋予代理创建新程序帖子或博客帖子的能力，具有内容类型选择、标题指定和日期设置等功能，利用Jekyll站点兼容性和Applesoft BASIC源代码集成。","ja":"エージェントが新しいプログラム投稿やブログ投稿を作成できるようにし、コンテンツタイプの選択、タイトルの指定、日付の設定などの機能を提供します。Jekyllサイトの互換性とApplesoft BASICソースコードの統合を利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 새로운 프로그램 포스트 또는 블로그 포스트를 생성할 수 있도록 하며, 콘텐츠 유형 선택, 제목 지정, 날짜 설정 등의 기능을 제공합니다. Jekyll 사이트 호환성 및 Applesoft BASIC 소스 코드 통합을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear nuevas publicaciones de programas o publicaciones de blogs con características como selección de tipo de contenido, especificación de título y configuración de fecha, utilizando la compatibilidad del sitio Jekyll y la integración del código fuente Applesoft BASIC.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer de nouvelles publications de programmes ou de blogs avec des fonctionnalités telles que la sélection du type de contenu, la spécification du titre et la configuration de la date, en utilisant la compatibilité du site Jekyll et l''intégration du code source Applesoft BASIC.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, neue Programmbeiträge oder Blogbeiträge mit Funktionen wie Inhaltstypauswahl, Titelspezifikation und Datumsfestlegung zu erstellen, unter Nutzung der Jekyll-Website-Kompatibilität und der Applesoft BASIC-Quellcode-Integration.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar novos posts de programas ou posts de blog com recursos como seleção de tipo de conteúdo, especificação de título e definição de data, utilizando a compatibilidade do site Jekyll e a integração do código-fonte Applesoft BASIC.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать новые посты программ или блог-посты с функциями, такими как выбор типа контента, указание названия и установка даты, используя совместимость сайта Jekyll и интеграцию исходного кода Applesoft BASIC.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء منشورات برامج أو مدونة جديدة مع ميزات مثل اختيار نوع المحتوى و تحديد العنوان و ضبط التاريخ، باستخدام توافق موقع Jekyll و دمج شفرة المصدر Applesoft BASIC."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating program posts with source code and screenshots","Creating blog posts for Apple II topics and site updates","Automating content creation for the Apple II Programs Jekyll site"],"zh":["生成包含源代码和屏幕截图的程序帖子","创建关于Apple II主题和站点更新的博客帖子","自动化Apple II Programs Jekyll站点的内容创建"],"ja":["ソースコードとスクリーンショットを含むプログラム投稿の生成","Apple IIのテーマやサイトの更新に関するブログ投稿の作成","Apple II Programs Jekyllサイトのコンテンツ作成の自動化"],"ko":["소스 코드와 스크린샷을 포함하는 프로그램 포스트 생성","Apple II 주제 및 사이트 업데이트에 대한 블로그 포스트 생성","Apple II Programs Jekyll 사이트의 콘텐츠 생성 자동화"],"es":["Generación de publicaciones de programas con código fuente y capturas de pantalla","Creación de publicaciones de blogs sobre temas Apple II y actualizaciones del sitio","Automatización de la creación de contenido para el sitio Jekyll de Programas Apple II"],"fr":["Génération de publications de programmes avec code source et captures d''écran","Création de publications de blogs sur les sujets Apple II et les mises à jour du site","Automatisation de la création de contenu pour le site Jekyll de Programmes Apple II"],"de":["Erstellung von Programmbeiträgen mit Quellcode und Screenshots","Erstellung von Blogbeiträgen zu Apple II-Themen und Website-Updates","Automatisierung der Erstellung von Inhalten für die Apple II-Programme Jekyll-Website"],"pt":["Geração de posts de programas com código-fonte e capturas de tela","Criação de posts de blog para tópicos Apple II e atualizações do site","Automação da criação de conteúdo para o site Apple II Programs Jekyll"],"ru":["Генерация постов программ с исходным кодом и скриншотами","Создание блог-постов на темы Apple II и обновления сайта","Автоматизация создания контента для сайта Apple II Programs Jekyll"],"ar":["إنشاء منشورات برامج مع شفرة المصدر والصور الشاشة","إنشاء منشورات مدونة لمواضيع Apple II و تحديثات الموقع","أتمتة إنشاء المحتوى لموقع Apple II Programs Jekyll"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Jekyll site compatibility","Limited to Applesoft BASIC programs and Apple II topics"],"zh":["需要Jekyll站点兼容性","仅限Applesoft BASIC程序和Apple II主题"],"ja":["Jekyllサイトの互換性が必要","Applesoft BASICプログラムとApple IIのテーマのみ"],"ko":["Jekyll 사이트 호환성이 필요","Applesoft BASIC 프로그램 및 Apple II 주제만"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con el sitio Jekyll","Limitado a programas Applesoft BASIC y temas Apple II"],"fr":["Nécessite la compatibilité du site Jekyll","Limité aux programmes Applesoft BASIC et aux sujets Apple II"],"de":["Benötigt Jekyll-Website-Kompatibilität","Begrenzt auf Applesoft BASIC-Programme und Apple II-Themen"],"pt":["Exige compatibilidade com o site Jekyll","Limitado a programas Applesoft BASIC e tópicos Apple II"],"ru":["Требует совместимости с сайтом Jekyll","Ограничен программами Applesoft BASIC и темами Apple II"],"ar":["يتطلب توافقاً مع موقع Jekyll","محدود ببرامج Applesoft BASIC ومواضيع Apple II"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"5ea91df32b5a4a9d42850cc1f3e06289ae61500c1f985c48febb9b31f8957666","qualityScore":39}');
