INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('fantasy-cc/credit-card-tracker/update-card-benefits', 'update-card-benefits', 'fantasy-cc', 'credit-card-tracker', 'community', 'update-card-benefits fantasy-cc credit-card-tracker community The update-card-benefits skill guides you through updating benefits for existing credit cards, ensuring all users see the changes. This 3-step process is crucial for maintaining consistency. update-card-benefits技能指导您更新现有信用卡的福利，确保所有用户看到变化 update-card-benefitsスキルは、既存のクレジットカードの福利を更新します update-card-benefits 스킬은 기존 신용카드의福利를 업데이트합니다 Actualiza beneficios de tarjetas en CouponCycle con este proceso de 3 pasos para asegurar que todos los usuarios vean los cambios Mettez à jour les avantages des cartes dans CouponCycle avec ce processus de 3 étapes pour vous assurer que tous les utilisateurs voient les modifications Aktualisieren Sie Kartenleistungen in CouponCycle mit diesem 3-Schritte-Prozess, um sicherzustellen, dass alle Benutzer die Änderungen sehen O skill update-card-benefits é um processo de 3 etapas para atualizar benefícios de cartão para todos os usuários, novos e existentes, editando o arquivo prisma/seed.ts Навык update-card-benefits представляет собой 3-ступенчатый процесс обновления льгот карт для всех пользователей, новых и существующих, путем редактирования файла prisma/seed.ts مهارة update-card-benefits هي عملية من 3 خطوات لتحديث فوائد البطاقة لجميع المستخدمين، الجدد والقائمين، من خلال تحرير ملف prisma/seed.ts how to use update-card-benefits update-card-benefits setup guide update-card-benefits alternative update-card-benefits vs CouponCycle prisma seed ts update benefits couponcycle update card benefits 更新卡片福利 AIエージェント工具 Prisma 信用卡福利 更新福利结构 更新卡片信息 AI工具 信用卡管理 Edits prisma/seed.ts to update benefit structures Ensures new users see updated benefits when adding cards Updates existing users'' benefit structures to reflect changes Follows a recommended 3-step workflow for seamless implementation update-card-benefits is a skill that updates benefits for existing credit cards in CouponCycle, ensuring all users see the changes through a 3-step process.');
