stado en React, como Redux y React Query","fr":"Un state-management-expert est un expert dans les technologies de gestion d''état en React, comme Redux et React Query","de":"Ein state-management-expert ist ein Experte für Zustandsverwaltungstechnologien in React, wie Redux und React Query","pt":"O que é State Management Expert? Um especialista em gestão de estado para aplicações React","ru":"Что такое ИИ Агент State Management Expert? Эксперт в области управления состоянием для приложений React","ar":"ما هو خبير إدارة الحالة؟ خبير في إدارة الحالة للتطبيقات React"},"features":{"en":["Recommends specialist experts for React component issues and performance profiling","Detects environment setup using bash commands like grep and find","Supports state management libraries including Redux, Zustand, Jotai, and Recoil","Provides guidance on API data fetching using Rest API and React Query","Analyzes package.json files for state management dependencies","Identifies store and slice files in project directories"],"zh":["支持 React 状态管理模式","集成 Redux、Zustand、Jotai 和 Recoil 库","优化应用性能","提供 React 组件问题解决方案","支持性能分析和 API 数据获取"],"ja":["React 状態管理パターンのサポート","Redux、Zustand、Jotai、Recoil ライブラリの統合","アプリケーションのパフォーマンス最適化","React コンポーネントの問題解決","パフォーマンス分析と API データ取得のサポート"],"ko":["React 상태 관리 패턴 지원","Redux, Zustand, Jotai, Recoil 라이브러리 통합","애플리케이션 성능 최적화","React 컴포넌트 문제 해결","성능 분석 및 API 데이터 가져오기 지원"],"es":["Recomienda expertos en componentes de React","Detecta entornos con Redux, Zustand, Jotai y Recoil","Realiza perfilado de rendimiento con React","Utiliza React Query para la recuperación de datos de API","Identifica problemas de estado en componentes de React"],"fr":["Recommande des experts en composants React","Détecte des environnements avec Redux, Zustand, Jotai et Recoil","Réalisé un profilage de performances avec React","Utilise React Query pour la récupération de données d''API","Identifie des problèmes d''état dans les composants React"],"de":["Empfiehlt Experten für React-Komponenten","Erkennung von Umgebungen mit Redux, Zustand, Jotai und Recoil","Durchführt Leistungsprofilierung mit React","Verwendet React Query für die Datenabruf von APIs","Identifiziert Zustandsprobleme in React-Komponenten"],"pt":["Suporte a bibliotecas de gestão de estado como Redux, Zustand, Jotai e Recoil","Detecção de ambiente com grep e find","Recomendação de especialistas para problemas de componentes React","Recomendação de especialistas para perfis de desempenho","Recomendação de especialistas para busca de dados API"],"ru":["Поддержка библиотек управления состоянием, таких как Redux, Zustand, Jotai и Recoil","Обнаружение окружения с помощью grep и find","Рекомендация специалистов для проблем компонентов React","Рекомендация специалистов для профилирования производительности","Рекомендация специалистов для запросов данных API"],"ar":["دعم مكتبات إدارة الحالة مثل Redux و Zustand و Jotai و Recoil","اكتشاف البيئة باستخدام grep و find","توصية الخبراء لمشاكل مكونات React","توصية الخبراء لملفات تعريف الأداء","توصية الخبراء لاستعلامات بيانات API"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use state-management-expert","state-management-expert vs Redux","state-management-expert setup guide","what is state-management-expert","state-management-expert alternative","React state management patterns","state-management-expert install","optimizing React performance with state-management-expert"],"zh":["State Management Expert","React 状态管理","AI 工具","状态管理解决方案","React 性能优化","Redux","Zustand","Jotai","Recoil"],"ja":["State Management Expert","React 状態管理","AI エージェント","状態管理ソリューション","React パフォーマンス最適化","Redux","Zustand","Jotai","Recoil"],"ko":["State Management Expert","React 상태 관리","AI 도구","상태 관리 솔루션","React 성능 최적화","Redux","Zustand","Jotai","Recoil"],"es":["state management en React","Redux","Zustand","React Query","manejo de estado en React","optimización de rendimiento en React","herramientas de estado en React","bibliotecas de estado en React","patrones de estado en React"],"fr":["gestion d''état en React","Redux","Zustand","React Query","gestion d''état en React","optimisation des performances en React","outils d''état en React","bibliothèques d''état en React","modèles d''état en React"],"de":["Zustandsverwaltung in React","Redux","Zustand","React Query","Zustandsverwaltung in React","Leistungsoptimierung in React","Zustandstools in React","Zustandsbibliotheken in React","Zustandsmuster in React"],"pt":["state management expert","gestão de estado react","bibliotecas de gestão de estado","redux","zustand","jotai","recoil","desenvolvimento de aplicações react"],"ru":["ИИ Агент State Management Expert","управление состоянием react","библиотеки управления состоянием","redux","zustand","jotai","recoil","разработка приложений react"],"ar":["خبير إدارة الحالة","إدارة الحالة للتفاعل","مكتبات إدارة الحالة","redux","zustand","jotai","recoil","تطوير التطبيقات React"]}},"owner":"ripgraphics","repo":"authorsinfo","repoPath":"ripgraphics/authorsinfo","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.496Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"state-management-expert","description":"Expert in React state management including Redux Toolkit, Zustand, Jotai, React Query/TanStack Query, and Context API. Use for state architecture decisions, performance issues, or complex state logic.","bodyPreview":"# State Management Expert\n\nExpert in React state management patterns and libraries.\n\n## When Invoked\n\n### Recommend Specialist\n- **React component issues**: recommend react-expert\n- **Performance profiling**: recommend react-performance-expert\n- **API data fetching only**: recommend rest-api-expert\n\n### Environment Detection\n```bash\ngrep -E \"redux|zustand|jotai|recoil|@tanstack/react-query\" package.json 2>/dev/null\nfind . -name \"store*\" -o -name \"*slice*\" | head -5\n```\n\n## State Management Decis","body":"# State Management Expert\n\nExpert in React state management patterns and libraries.\n\n## When Invoked\n\n### Recommend Specialist\n- **React component issues**: recommend react-expert\n- **Performance profiling**: recommend react-performance-expert\n- **API data fetching only**: recommend rest-api-expert\n\n### Environment Detection\n```bash\ngrep -E \"redux|zustand|jotai|recoil|@tanstack/react-query\" package.json 2>/dev/null\nfind . -name \"store*\" -o -name \"*slice*\" | head -5\n```\n\n## State Management Decision Tree\n\n```\nState Type?\n├─ Server State (API data) → TanStack Query / SWR\n├─ Global UI State → Zustand / Redux Toolkit\n├─ Form State → React Hook Form / Formik\n├─ URL State → nuqs / useSearchParams\n└─ Local State → useState / useReducer\n```\n\n## Problem Playbooks\n\n### Zustand (Recommended for most apps)\n\n```typescript\nimport { create } from ''zustand'';\nimport { devtools, persist } from ''zustand/middleware'';\n\ninterface UserStore {\n  user: User | null;\n  setUser: (user: User | null) => void;\n  logout: () => void;\n}\n\nexport const useUserStore = create<UserStore>()(\n  devtools(\n    persist(\n      (set) => ({\n        user: null,\n        setUser: (user) => set({ user }),\n        logout: () => set({ user: null }),\n      }),\n      { name: ''user-store'' }\n    )\n  )\n);\n\n// Usage\nfunction Component() {\n  const user = useUserStore((state) => state.user);\n  const setUser = useUserStore((state) => state.setUser);\n}\n```\n\n### Redux Toolkit\n\n```typescript\nimport { createSlice, configureStore } from ''@reduxjs/toolkit'';\n\nconst counterSlice = createSlice({\n  name: ''counter'',\n  initialState: { value: 0 },\n  reducers: {\n    increment: (state) => { state.value += 1; },\n    decrement: (state) => { state.value -= 1; },\n  },\n});\n\nexport const store = configureStore({\n  reducer: { counter: counterSlice.reducer },\n});\n\nexport const { increment, decrement } = counterSlice.actions;\n```\n\n### TanStack Query (Server State)\n\n```typescript\nimport { useQuery, useMutation, useQueryClient } from ''@tanstack/react-query'';\n\nfunction usePosts() {\n  return useQuery({\n    queryKey: [''posts''],\n    queryFn: () => fetch(''/api/posts'').then(r => r.json()),\n    staleTime: 5 * 60 * 1000, // 5 minutes\n  });\n}\n\nfunction useCreatePost() {\n  const queryClient = useQueryClient();\n  \n  return useMutation({\n    mutationFn: (data: CreatePostDto) => \n      fetch(''/api/posts'', {\n        method: ''POST'',\n        body: JSON.stringify(data),\n      }),\n    onSuccess: () => {\n      queryClient.invalidateQueries({ queryKey: [''posts''] });\n    },\n  });\n}\n```\n\n### Context API (Simple cases)\n\n```typescript\nconst ThemeContext = createContext<ThemeContextValue | null>(null);\n\nexport function ThemeProvider({ children }: { children: ReactNode }) {\n  const [theme, setTheme] = useState<''light'' | ''dark''>(''light'');\n  \n  const value = useMemo(() => ({ theme, setTheme }), [theme]);\n  \n  return (\n    <ThemeContext.Provider value={value}>\n      {children}\n    </ThemeContext.Provider>\n  );\n}\n\nexport function useTheme() {\n  const context = useContext(ThemeContext);\n  if (!context) throw new Error(''useTheme must be within ThemeProvider'');\n  return context;\n}\n```\n\n## Code Review Checklist\n\n- [ ] Server state uses TanStack Query or SWR\n- [ ] No prop drilling >2 levels\n- [ ] Selectors used for derived state\n- [ ] State normalized (no duplicates)\n- [ ] Optimistic updates for mutations\n- [ ] Loading/error states handled\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n1. **Storing server data in Redux** - Use React Query\n2. **Global state for local concerns** - Use useState\n3. **Over-fetching with Context** - Split contexts\n4. **Missing selectors** - Causes unnecessary re-renders\n5. **Duplicate state** - Single source of truth\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:10:13.304Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing expertise in React state management patterns and libraries like Redux, Zustand, Jotai, Recoil, and @tanstack/react-query.","zh":"非常适合需要在React状态管理模式和库（如Redux、Zustand、Jotai、Recoil和@tanstack/react-query）方面具有专业知识的前端代理。","ja":"Reactの状態管理パターンとライブラリ（例： Redux、Zustand、Jotai、Recoil、@tanstack/react-query）に関する専門知識が必要なフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"React 상태 관리 패턴과 라이브러리(예: Redux, Zustand, Jotai, Recoil, @tanstack/react-query)에 대한 전문 지식이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan experiencia en patrones y bibliotecas de gestión de estado de React como Redux, Zustand, Jotai, Recoil y @tanstack/react-query.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin d''expertise dans les modèles et les bibliothèques de gestion d''état React comme Redux, Zustand, Jotai, Recoil et @tanstack/react-query.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die Expertenwissen in React-Zustandsverwaltungsmustern und -bibliotheken wie Redux, Zustand, Jotai, Recoil und @tanstack/react-query benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de especialização em padrões de gerenciamento de estado do React e bibliotecas como Redux, Zustand, Jotai, Recoil e @tanstack/react-query.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы знания в области шаблонов управления состоянием React и библиотек, таких как Redux, Zustand, Jotai, Recoil и @tanstack/react-query.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى خبرة في أنماط إدارة الحالة في React والمكتبات مثل Redux وZustand وJotai وRecoil و@tanstack/react-query."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize complex component issues and performance optimization using advanced state management techniques, including environment detection and specialist recommendations for React component issues, performance profiling, and API data fetching.","zh":"赋予代理优化复杂组件问题和性能优化的能力，使用高级状态管理技术，包括环境检测和React组件问题、性能分析和API数据获取的专家建议。","ja":"エージェントに複雑なコンポーネントの問題とパフォーマンスの最適化を可能にし、高度な状態管理技術を使用します。環境検出やReactコンポーネントの問題、パフォーマンスプロファイリング、APIデータ取得に関する専門家の推奨事項も含まれます。","ko":"에이전트가 복잡한 컴포넌트 문제와 성능 최적화를 가능하게 하며, 고급 상태 관리 기술을 사용하여 환경 감지 및 React 컴포넌트 문제, 성능 프로파일링, API 데이터 가져오기 위한 전문가 추천을 포함합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a optimizar problemas complejos de componentes y la optimización del rendimiento utilizando técnicas avanzadas de gestión de estado, incluyendo la detección de entornos y recomendaciones especializadas para problemas de componentes de React, perfil de rendimiento y obtención de datos de API.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser des problèmes de composants complexes et l''optimisation des performances en utilisant des techniques avancées de gestion d''état, y compris la détection d''environnement et des recommandations spécialisées pour les problèmes de composants React, le profil de performances et la récupération de données d''API.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, komplexe Komponentenprobleme und Leistungsoptimierung mithilfe fortschrittlicher Zustandsverwaltungstechniken zu optimieren, einschließlich Umgebungsverzeichnung und spezifische Empfehlungen für React-Komponentenprobleme, Leistungsprofilierung und API-Datenabruf.","pt":"Permite que os agentes otimizem problemas complexos de componentes e otimização de desempenho usando técnicas avançadas de gerenciamento de estado, incluindo detecção de ambiente e recomendações especializadas para problemas de componentes do React, perfil de desempenho e fetch de dados da API.","ru":"Позволяет агентам оптимизировать сложные проблемы компонентов и оптимизацию производительности с помощью передовых техник управления состоянием, включая обнаружение окружения и специализированные рекомендации для проблем компонентов React, профилирования производительности и извлечения данных API.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تحسين مشاكل المركبات المعقدة وتحسين الأداء باستخدام تقنيات متقدمة لإدارة الحالة، بما في ذلك اكتشاف البيئة وتوصيات متخصصة لمشاكل مكونات React وتصفية الأداء واسترجاع بيانات API."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging complex React component issues","Optimizing performance using Redux, Zustand, or Recoil","Integrating @tanstack/react-query for data fetching and caching"],"zh":["调试复杂的React组件问题","使用Redux、Zustand或Recoil优化性能","集成@tanstack/react-query进行数据获取和缓存"],"ja":["複雑なReactコンポーネントの問題をデバッグする","Redux、Zustand、またはRecoilを使用してパフォーマンスを最適化する","@tanstack/react-queryを統合してデータを取得およびキャッシュする"],"ko":["복잡한 React 컴포넌트 문제 디버깅","Redux, Zustand 또는 Recoil을 사용하여 성능 최적화","@tanstack/react-query를 통합하여 데이터 가져오기 및 캐싱"],"es":["Depuración de problemas complejos de componentes de React","Optimización del rendimiento utilizando Redux, Zustand o Recoil","Integración de @tanstack/react-query para la obtención y almacenamiento en caché de datos"],"fr":["Débogage de problèmes complexes de composants React","Optimisation des performances en utilisant Redux, Zustand ou Recoil","Intégration de @tanstack/react-query pour la récupération et la mise en cache de données"],"de":["Fehlerbehebung komplexer React-Komponentenprobleme","Leistungsoptimierung unter Verwendung von Redux, Zustand oder Recoil","Integration von @tanstack/react-query für Datenabruf und Zwischenspeicherung"],"pt":["Depuração de problemas complexos de componentes do React","Otimização de desempenho usando Redux, Zustand ou Recoil","Integração do @tanstack/react-query para fetch de dados e cache"],"ru":["Отладка сложных проблем компонентов React","Оптимизация производительности с помощью Redux, Zustand или Recoil","Интеграция @tanstack/react-query для извлечения данных и кэширования"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء مكونات React المعقدة","تحسين الأداء باستخدام Redux أو Zustand أو Recoil","دمج @tanstack/react-query لاسترجاع البيانات وتخزينها مؤقتا"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React project setup","Limited to React state management libraries","Environment detection requires access to package.json and project files"],"zh":["需要React项目设置","仅限React状态管理库","环境检测需要访问package.json和项目文件"],"ja":["Reactプロジェクトの設定が必要","React状態管理ライブラリのみに限定","環境検出にはpackage.jsonとプロジェクトファイルへのアクセスが必要"],"ko":["React 프로젝트 설정이 필요","React 상태 관리 라이브러리만 제한","환경 감지에는 package.json 및 프로젝트 파일에 대한 액세스가 필요"],"es":["Requiere configuración del proyecto React","Limitado a bibliotecas de gestión de estado de React","La detección de entornos requiere acceso a package.json y archivos de proyecto"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de projet React","Limité aux bibliothèques de gestion d''état React","La détection d''environnement nécessite l''accès à package.json et aux fichiers de projet"],"de":["Benötigt React-Projektsetup","Begrenzt auf React-Zustandsverwaltungsbibliotheken","Umgebungsverzeichnung erfordert Zugriff auf package.json und Projektdateien"],"pt":["Requer configuração do projeto do React","Limitado a bibliotecas de gerenciamento de estado do React","Detecção de ambiente requer acesso ao package.json e arquivos do projeto"],"ru":["Требуется настройка проекта React","Ограничен библиотеками управления состоянием React","Обнаружение окружения требует доступа к package.json и файлам проекта"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد مشروع React","محدود بمكتبات إدارة الحالة في React","اكتشاف البيئة يتطلب الوصول إلى package.json وملفات المشروع"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"8ba7dea7ca9b5bef6dd307d36de5af77e8ab9a59e889ba180c2ed9aa9427674b","qualityScore":39}');
