ェント開発を容易にするツールキットです","ko":"new-tool-scaffolder는 Next.js 개발을 위한 도구입니다","es":"new-tool-scaffolder es un agente de AI que permite crear estructuras de herramientas personalizadas en SuperTool","fr":"new-tool-scaffolder est un agent IA qui permet de créer des structures d''outils personnalisés dans SuperTool","de":"new-tool-scaffolder ist ein KI-Agent, der das Erstellen benutzerdefinierter Tool-Strukturen in SuperTool ermöglicht","pt":"O new-tool-scaffolder é uma ferramenta de desenvolvimento que permite criar ferramentas personalizadas com Next.js 16 e React 19","ru":"ИИ Агенты: new-tool-scaffolder - это инструмент для разработки индивидуальных инструментов с Next.js 16 и React 19","ar":"new-tool-scaffolder هو أداة تطوير لإنشاء أدوات مخصصة مع Next.js 16 و React 19"},"features":{"en":["Generates tool structures under `app/tools/<category>/<tool-slug>/`","Utilizes Panda CSS for styling","Leverages Vitest + Playwright for testing","Supports deployment to Vercel","Creates `page.tsx` main tool components with ''use client'' directive","Follows Next.js 16 and React 19 standards"],"zh":["支持 Next.js 16 和 React 19","使用 Panda CSS 进行样式设置","使用 Vitest 和 Playwright 进行测试","部署到 Vercel","工具分类和管理","支持多种工具开发"],"ja":["Next.js 16 と React 19 をサポート","Panda CSS を使用したスタイル設定","Vitest と Playwright を使用したテスト","Vercel へのデプロイ","ツールのカテゴリ化と管理","多種多様なツール開発をサポート"],"ko":["Next.js 16 및 React 19 지원","Panda CSS를 사용한 스타일 설정","Vitest 및 Playwright를 사용한 테스트","Vercel에 대한 배포","도구 분류 및 관리","다양한 도구 개발 지원"],"es":["Compatibilidad con Next.js 16 y React 19","Uso de Panda CSS para estilos","Pruebas con Vitest y Playwright","Despliegue en Vercel","Estructura de herramientas personalizables","Soporte para 36+ herramientas basadas en navegador"],"fr":["Compatibilité avec Next.js 16 et React 19","Utilisation de Panda CSS pour les styles","Tests avec Vitest et Playwright","Déploiement sur Vercel","Structure d''outils personnalisables","Prise en charge de 36+ outils basés sur navigateur"],"de":["Kompatibilität mit Next.js 16 und React 19","Verwendung von Panda CSS für Stile","Tests mit Vitest und Playwright","Bereitstellung auf Vercel","Struktur für benutzerdefinierte Tools","Unterstützung für 36+ Browser-basierte Tools"],"pt":["Suporte a Next.js 16 e React 19","Utilização de Panda CSS para estilização","Testes com Vitest e Playwright","Deploy automático para Vercel","Estrutura de ferramentas personalizadas com categorias e slugs","Compatibilidade com ''use client'' em page.tsx"],"ru":["Поддержка Next.js 16 и React 19","Использование Panda CSS для стилизации","Тестирование с Vitest и Playwright","Автоматический деплой на Vercel","Структура индивидуальных инструментов с категориями и слагами","Совместимость с ''use client'' в page.tsx"],"ar":["دعم Next.js 16 و React 19","استخدام Panda CSS للتنسيق","اختبارات مع Vitest و Playwright","نشر تلقائي إلى Vercel","هيكل أدوات مخصصة مع فئات و slugs","توافق مع ''use client'' في page.tsx"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use new-tool-scaffolder","new-tool-scaffolder setup guide","new-tool-scaffolder alternative","new-tool-scaffolder vs create-next-app","new-tool-scaffolder install","what is new-tool-scaffolder","new-tool-scaffolder documentation","new-tool-scaffolder tutorial","new-tool-scaffolder and Next.js 16","new-tool-scaffolder with Vitest and Playwright"],"zh":["new-tool-scaffolder","Next.js 16","React 19","Panda CSS","Vitest","Playwright","Vercel","工具开发","AI开发工具"],"ja":["new-tool-scaffolder","Next.js 16","React 19","Panda CSS","Vitest","Playwright","Vercel","AIエージェント開発","ツール開発"],"ko":["new-tool-scaffolder","Next.js 16","React 19","Panda CSS","Vitest","Playwright","Vercel","도구 개발","AI 개발 도구"],"es":["new-tool-scaffolder","SuperTool","Next.js 16","React 19","Panda CSS","Vitest","Playwright","Vercel","herramientas personalizadas","desarrollo de herramientas"],"fr":["new-tool-scaffolder","SuperTool","Next.js 16","React 19","Panda CSS","Vitest","Playwright","Vercel","outils personnalisés","développement d''outils"],"de":["new-tool-scaffolder","SuperTool","Next.js 16","React 19","Panda CSS","Vitest","Playwright","Vercel","benutzerdefinierte Tools","Tool-Entwicklung"],"pt":["new-tool-scaffolder","Next.js 16","React 19","Panda CSS","Vitest","Playwright","Vercel","desenvolvimento de ferramentas","ferramentas personalizadas","desenvolvedores"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","new-tool-scaffolder","Next.js 16","React 19","Panda CSS","Vitest","Playwright","Vercel","разработка индивидуальных инструментов","индивидуальные инструменты","разработчики"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","new-tool-scaffolder","Next.js 16","React 19","Panda CSS","Vitest","Playwright","Vercel","تطوير أدوات مخصصة","أدوات مخصصة","مطورون"]}},"owner":"ferryhinardi","repo":"supertool","repoPath":"ferryhinardi/supertool","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.502Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"new-tool-scaffolder","description":"Scaffolds a complete new tool page for SuperTool. Use this skill when asked to add a new tool — it creates the page component, layout with SEO metadata, test files, docs, and registers the tool in the tools registry.","bodyPreview":"# new-tool-scaffolder\n\n## Project Context\nSuperTool is a Next.js 16 (React 19) developer toolkit with 36+ browser-based tools. Uses Panda CSS for styling, Vitest + Playwright for testing, and deploys to Vercel.\n\n## Tool Structure\nEach tool lives under `app/tools/<category>/<tool-slug>/` where category is one of: `data`, `media`, `development`, `productivity`, `security`, `finance`, `design`.\n\n### Required files per tool:\n1. **`page.tsx`** — Main tool component (use `''use client''`). Copy patterns","body":"# new-tool-scaffolder\n\n## Project Context\nSuperTool is a Next.js 16 (React 19) developer toolkit with 36+ browser-based tools. Uses Panda CSS for styling, Vitest + Playwright for testing, and deploys to Vercel.\n\n## Tool Structure\nEach tool lives under `app/tools/<category>/<tool-slug>/` where category is one of: `data`, `media`, `development`, `productivity`, `security`, `finance`, `design`.\n\n### Required files per tool:\n1. **`page.tsx`** — Main tool component (use `''use client''`). Copy patterns from `TOOL_PAGE_TEMPLATE.tsx`:\n   - Panda CSS via `css()` from `@/styled-system/css` (NOT Tailwind)\n   - Framer Motion animations with `useReducedMotion` support\n   - `trackToolEvent()` from `@/lib/services/analytics` for analytics\n   - 44px minimum touch targets\n   - Mobile-first responsive layout with `maxW: ''7xl''`\n   - Loading states, error handling with `toast` from `sonner`\n   - UI components from `@/components/ui/` (Button, Card, Input, etc.)\n\n2. **`layout.tsx`** — SEO metadata using `generateToolMetadata()` from `@/lib/data/metadata` and structured data schemas from `@/lib/data/structured-data` (`generateBreadcrumbSchema`, `generateFAQSchema`, `generateHowToSchema`).\n\n3. **`__tests__/page.test.tsx`** — Vitest + Testing Library test file:\n   ```tsx\n   import { render, screen } from ''@testing-library/react''\n   import { describe, it, expect } from ''vitest''\n4. __tests__/logic.test.ts — Unit tests for pure logic/utility functions.\n5. docs/<NUMBER>_<TOOL_NAME>.md — Documentation with: Overview, Purpose, Key Features, Technical Details sections. Number sequentially after the last existing doc.\n\nTool Registration\nAdd the tool entry to lib/data/tools.ts in the tools array with:\n•  title, description, icon (from lucide-react), href (/tools/<category>/<slug>)\n•  gradient (Tailwind gradient string like ''from-purple-500 to-pink-500'')\n•  features (array of 4 short feature strings)\n•  category (matching the directory category)\n•  new: true flag for newly added tools\n\nCode Style\n•  Biome enforces: 2-space indent, single quotes, no semicolons, 100-char lines\n•  Imports use @/ prefix. Order: React/Next → 3rd party → UI → Features → Utils\n•  Strict TypeScript: never use any\n•  One component per file\n\nValidation Steps (run after scaffolding)\n1. pnpm exec tsc --noEmit — Type check\n2. pnpm lint:check — Lint check\n3. pnpm test -- --run <path-to-tests> — Run new tests\n4. pnpm build — Ensure production build succeeds\n\nReference Files\n•  Template: TOOL_PAGE_TEMPLATE.tsx\n•  Canonical example: app/tools/data/json-beautify/page.tsx\n•  Layout example: app/tools/data/json-beautify/layout.tsx\n•  Tools registry: lib/data/tools.ts\n•  Agent reference: AGENTS.md\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:10:18.951Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Next.js 16 Developer Agents needing efficient tool structure generation with Panda CSS and Vitest + Playwright.","zh":"非常适合需要使用Panda CSS和Vitest + Playwright高效生成工具结构的Next.js 16开发者代理","ja":"Next.js 16の開発者エージェント向けに、Panda CSSとVitest + Playwrightを使用したツール構造の効率的な生成に最適","ko":"Panda CSS와 Vitest + Playwright를 사용하여 도구 구조를 효율적으로 생성하는 Next.js 16 개발자 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollador de Next.js 16 que necesitan una generación eficiente de estructuras de herramientas con Panda CSS y Vitest + Playwright.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développeur Next.js 16 ayant besoin d''une génération efficace de structures d''outils avec Panda CSS et Vitest + Playwright.","de":"Perfekt für Next.js 16-Entwickleragenten, die eine effiziente Generierung von Tool-Strukturen mit Panda CSS und Vitest + Playwright benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Next.js 16 que necessitam de estrutura de ferramentas eficiente com Panda CSS e Vitest + Playwright.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработчиков Next.js 16, которым требуется эффективная структура инструментов с Panda CSS и Vitest + Playwright.","ar":"مثالي للموكلين مطورو Next.js 16 الذين يحتاجون إلى هيكل أدوات فعال مع Panda CSS و Vitest + Playwright."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate comprehensive tool structures for browser-based tools within the SuperTool toolkit, utilizing Panda CSS for styling and Vitest + Playwright for testing, and deploying to Vercel.","zh":"赋予代理生成SuperTool工具包中基于浏览器的工具的全面工具结构的能力，利用Panda CSS进行样式设置，利用Vitest + Playwright进行测试，并部署到Vercel","ja":"エージェントに、SuperToolツールキット内のブラウザベースのツールの包括的なツール構造を生成する能力を付与し、Panda CSSを使用してスタイリングを行い、Vitest + Playwrightを使用してテストを行い、Vercelにデプロイする","ko":"에이전트에 SuperTool 툴킷 내의 브라우저 기반 도구를 위한 포괄적인 도구 구조를 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, Pand CSS를 사용하여 스타일을 지정하고, Vitest + Playwright를 사용하여 테스트를 수행하며, Vercel에 배포","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar estructuras de herramientas integrales para herramientas basadas en navegador dentro de la herramienta SuperTool, utilizando Panda CSS para el estilo y Vitest + Playwright para las pruebas, y desplegando en Vercel.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des structures d''outils complètes pour les outils basés sur le navigateur au sein de la boîte à outils SuperTool, en utilisant Panda CSS pour la mise en page et Vitest + Playwright pour les tests, et en déployant sur Vercel.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, umfassende Tool-Strukturen für browserbasierte Tools innerhalb des SuperTool-Toolkits zu generieren, wobei Panda CSS für die Gestaltung und Vitest + Playwright für die Tests verwendet werden, und auf Vercel bereitgestellt werden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerem estruturas de ferramentas abrangentes para ferramentas baseadas em navegador dentro da caixa de ferramentas SuperTool, utilizando Panda CSS para estilização e Vitest + Playwright para testes e implantando no Vercel.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать комплексные структуры инструментов для инструментов на основе браузера внутри набора инструментов SuperTool, используя Panda CSS для стилей и Vitest + Playwright для тестирования, и развертывать на Vercel.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء هيكل أدوات شاملة للأدوات المعتمدة على المتصفح داخل صندوق أدوات SuperTool، باستخدام Panda CSS للتنسيق وVitest + Playwright للاختبار، والنشر على Vercel."},"useCases":{"en":["Scaffolding new tools under specific categories like data, media, or development","Generating main tool components with ''use client'' in page.tsx files","Creating tool structures that follow the SuperTool toolkit''s conventions"],"zh":["在特定类别（如数据、媒体或开发）下创建新工具的脚手架","在page.tsx文件中使用''use client''生成主要工具组件","创建遵循SuperTool工具包约定的工具结构"],"ja":["特定のカテゴリ（データ、メディア、開発など）下で新しいツールのスキャフォールディングを生成する","page.tsxファイルで''use client''を使用して主要なツールコンポーネントを生成する","SuperToolツールキットの規約に従ったツール構造を生成する"],"ko":["특정 카테고리(데이터, 미디어, 개발 등) 아래에서 새로운 도구의 스캐폴딩을 생성","page.tsx 파일에서 ''use client''를 사용하여 주요 도구 컴포넌트를 생성","SuperTool 툴킷의 규약을 따르는 도구 구조를 생성"],"es":["Crear estructuras de herramientas nuevas bajo categorías específicas como datos, medios o desarrollo","Generar componentes principales de herramientas con ''use client'' en archivos page.tsx","Crear estructuras de herramientas que siguen las convenciones de la herramienta SuperTool"],"fr":["Créer de nouvelles structures d''outils sous des catégories spécifiques comme les données, les médias ou le développement","Générer les composants principaux d''outils avec ''use client'' dans les fichiers page.tsx","Créer des structures d''outils qui suivent les conventions de la boîte à outils SuperTool"],"de":["Erstellen von neuen Tool-Strukturen unter bestimmten Kategorien wie Daten, Medien oder Entwicklung","Generieren von Hauptkomponenten von Tools mit ''use client'' in page.tsx-Dateien","Erstellen von Tool-Strukturen, die den Konventionen des SuperTool-Toolkits folgen"],"pt":["Criação de novas ferramentas sob categorias específicas como dados, mídia ou desenvolvimento","Geração de componentes principais de ferramentas com ''use client'' em arquivos page.tsx","Criação de estruturas de ferramentas que seguem as convenções da caixa de ferramentas SuperTool"],"ru":["Создание новых инструментов под конкретные категории, такие как данные, медиа или разработка","Генерация основных компонентов инструментов с ''use client'' в файлах page.tsx","Создание структур инструментов, соответствующих соглашениям набора инструментов SuperTool"],"ar":["إنشاء أدوات جديدة تحت فئات محددة مثل البيانات أو الإعلام أو التطوير","генерация مكونات الأدوات الرئيسية مع ''use client'' في ملفات page.tsx","إ