INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('entazis/product-reviews/pull-request', 'pull-request', 'entazis', 'product-reviews', 'community', 'pull-request entazis product-reviews community The pull-request skill handles product reviews with a system that enforces a pre-flight checklist, ensuring code quality and security. It benefits developers by automating testing and review processes. Pull Request是一种代码审查系统，确保代码格式化、行为变化测试和秘密保护 Pull Requestはコードレビューシステムで、コードのフォーマット、テスト、シークレットの保護を担う Pull Request는 코드 리뷰 시스템으로 코드 형식화, 행동 변경 테스트 및 비밀 보호를 담당합니다 El sistema de pull-request permite una revisión y validación eficaces de los cambios de código antes de su implementación Le système de pull-request permet une révision et une validation efficaces des modifications de code avant leur mise en œuvre Das pull-request-System ermöglicht eine effektive Überprüfung und Validierung von Code-Änderungen vor ihrer Implementierung O pull request é um sistema para lidar com revisões de produtos, garantindo que o código seja formatado e testado Pull request - это система для обработки обзоров продуктов, обеспечивающая форматирование и тестирование кода для ИИ Агентов طلب السحب هو نظام للتعامل مع المراجعات المنتجات، ويضمن تنسيق الشفرة واختبارها how to use pull-request pull-request setup guide what is pull-request pull-request alternative pull-request vs git request pull-request install pull-request pre-flight checklist pull-request gofmt pull-request goimports Pull Request 代码审查 代码格式化 行为变化测试 秘密保护 AI工具 代码review Enforces scope focus with no unrelated refactors Automates code formatting using gofmt and goimports Prevents secrets from being checked in, including env files and credentials Ensures behavior changes are tested with targeted tests and full suite when appropriate Supports review mutations with aggregates updating in the same DB transaction and outbox events emission pull-request is a system for handling product reviews that enforces a pre-flight checklist, including code formatting with gofmt and goimports, and testing behavior changes.');
