pour l''automatisation de navigateur","de":"Playwright-cli ist ein Kommandozeilen-Tool zur Browser-Automatisierung","pt":"O playwright-cli é uma ferramenta de linha de comando para automação de navegadores","ru":"Playwright-cli - это командная утилита для автоматизации браузеров","ar":"playwright-cli هو أداة سطر أوامر لآلة автоматизации المتصفحات"},"features":{"en":["Opens new browser instances using the `open` command","Navigates to specific web pages using the `goto` command","Interacts with web pages using refs from snapshots, such as clicking elements","Takes screenshots of web pages using the `screenshot` command","Closes browser instances using the `close` command","Supports typing and pressing keys using the `type` and `press` commands"],"zh":["快速打开浏览器","支持导航和交互","支持截图","支持快捷键操作","支持命令行参数"],"ja":["ブラウザの開閉","ナビゲーションと操作のサポート","スクリーンショットの取得","ショートカットキーの操作","コマンドラインパラメータのサポート"],"ko":["빠른 브라우저 열기","탐색 및 상호작용 지원","스크린샷 지원","단축키 작동 지원","명령행 매개변수 지원"],"es":["Abrir y navegar por páginas web con comandos como open y goto","Interactuar con elementos de la página utilizando referencias de la instantánea","Capturar pantallas con el comando screenshot","Cerrar el navegador con el comando close","Utilizar comandos como click y type para interactuar con la página"],"fr":["Ouvrir et naviguer dans des pages web avec des commandes comme open et goto","Interagir avec des éléments de la page en utilisant des références de l''instantané","Capturer des écrans avec la commande screenshot","Fermer le navigateur avec la commande close","Utiliser des commandes comme click et type pour interagir avec la page"],"de":["Öffnen und navigieren von Webseiten mit Befehlen wie open und goto","Interagieren mit Elementen der Seite mithilfe von Referenzen des Snapshots","Bildschirme mit dem Befehl screenshot erfassen","Den Browser mit dem Befehl close schließen","Befehle wie click und type verwenden, um mit der Seite zu interagieren"],"pt":["Abre e navega em páginas da web","Interage com páginas da web usando referências de snapshot","Captura telas de páginas da web","Fecha o navegador","Suporta comandos de CLI para automação"],"ru":["Открывает и навигирует по веб-страницам","Взаимодействует с веб-страницами с использованием ссылок на снимки","Делает снимки экрана веб-страниц","Закрывает браузер","Поддерживает команды CLI для автоматизации"],"ar":["فتح وتنقل صفحات الويب","التفاعل مع صفحات الويب باستخدام مراجع لملفات تعريف","تسجيل الشاشة لصفحات الويب","إغلاق المتصفح","دعم أوامر سطر أوامر للآلية"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use playwright-cli","playwright-cli alternative","playwright-cli setup guide","browser automation with playwright-cli","playwright-cli vs puppeteer","playwright-cli install","what is playwright-cli","playwright-cli documentation","playwright-cli tutorial"],"zh":["playwright-cli","浏览器自动化","命令行工具","快速打开浏览器","导航和交互","截图","AIエージェント","自动化测试"],"ja":["playwright-cli","ブラウザ自動化","コマンドラインツール","ブラウザの開閉","ナビゲーションと操作","スクリーンショット","AIエージェント","自動テスト"],"ko":["playwright-cli","브라우저 자동화","명령행 도구","빠른 브라우저 열기","탐색 및 상호작용","스크린샷","AI 에이전트","자동화 테스트"],"es":["playwright-cli","automatización de navegador","comandos de línea de comandos","interacción con elementos de la página","captura de pantallas","herramientas de desarrollo web","automatización de pruebas","navegador automático"],"fr":["playwright-cli","automatisation de navigateur","commandes en ligne de commande","interaction avec des éléments de la page","capture d''écrans","outils de développement web","automatisation de tests","navigateur automatique"],"de":["playwright-cli","Browser-Automatisierung","Kommandozeilen-Befehle","Interaktion mit Elementen der Seite","Bildschirmaufnahme","Webentwicklungstools","Automatisierung von Tests","Automatischer Browser"],"pt":["playwright-cli","automação de navegadores","ferramenta de linha de comando","CLI","captura de telas","interação com páginas da web","navegação em páginas da web","fechamento de navegador"],"ru":["playwright-cli","автоматизация браузеров","командная утилита","CLI","снимки экрана","взаимодействие с веб-страницами","навигация по веб-страницам","закрытие браузера"],"ar":["playwright-cli","آلة автоматизации المتصفحات","أداة سطر أوامر","CLI","تسجيل الشاشة","التفاعل مع صفحات الويب","تنقل صفحات الويب","إغلاق المتصفح"]}},"owner":"wangfh5","repo":"WfhZoteroTools","repoPath":"wangfh5/WfhZoteroTools","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.589Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"playwright-cli","description":"Automates browser interactions for web testing, form filling, screenshots, and data extraction. Use when the user needs to navigate websites, interact with web pages, fill forms, take screenshots, test web applications, or extract information from web pages.","bodyPreview":"# Browser Automation with playwright-cli\n\n## Quick start\n\n```bash\n# open new browser\nplaywright-cli open\n# navigate to a page\nplaywright-cli goto https://playwright.dev\n# interact with the page using refs from the snapshot\nplaywright-cli click e15\nplaywright-cli type \"page.click\"\nplaywright-cli press Enter\n# take a screenshot\nplaywright-cli screenshot\n# close the browser\nplaywright-cli close\n```\n\n## Commands\n\n### Core\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli open\n# open and navigate right away\nplaywright-cli ope","body":"# Browser Automation with playwright-cli\n\n## Quick start\n\n```bash\n# open new browser\nplaywright-cli open\n# navigate to a page\nplaywright-cli goto https://playwright.dev\n# interact with the page using refs from the snapshot\nplaywright-cli click e15\nplaywright-cli type \"page.click\"\nplaywright-cli press Enter\n# take a screenshot\nplaywright-cli screenshot\n# close the browser\nplaywright-cli close\n```\n\n## Commands\n\n### Core\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli open\n# open and navigate right away\nplaywright-cli open https://example.com/\nplaywright-cli goto https://playwright.dev\nplaywright-cli type \"search query\"\nplaywright-cli click e3\nplaywright-cli dblclick e7\nplaywright-cli fill e5 \"user@example.com\"\nplaywright-cli drag e2 e8\nplaywright-cli hover e4\nplaywright-cli select e9 \"option-value\"\nplaywright-cli upload ./document.pdf\nplaywright-cli check e12\nplaywright-cli uncheck e12\nplaywright-cli snapshot\nplaywright-cli snapshot --filename=after-click.yaml\nplaywright-cli eval \"document.title\"\nplaywright-cli eval \"el => el.textContent\" e5\nplaywright-cli dialog-accept\nplaywright-cli dialog-accept \"confirmation text\"\nplaywright-cli dialog-dismiss\nplaywright-cli resize 1920 1080\nplaywright-cli close\n```\n\n### Navigation\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli go-back\nplaywright-cli go-forward\nplaywright-cli reload\n```\n\n### Keyboard\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli press Enter\nplaywright-cli press ArrowDown\nplaywright-cli keydown Shift\nplaywright-cli keyup Shift\n```\n\n### Mouse\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli mousemove 150 300\nplaywright-cli mousedown\nplaywright-cli mousedown right\nplaywright-cli mouseup\nplaywright-cli mouseup right\nplaywright-cli mousewheel 0 100\n```\n\n### Save as\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli screenshot\nplaywright-cli screenshot e5\nplaywright-cli screenshot --filename=page.png\nplaywright-cli pdf --filename=page.pdf\n```\n\n### Tabs\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli tab-list\nplaywright-cli tab-new\nplaywright-cli tab-new https://example.com/page\nplaywright-cli tab-close\nplaywright-cli tab-close 2\nplaywright-cli tab-select 0\n```\n\n### Storage\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli state-save\nplaywright-cli state-save auth.json\nplaywright-cli state-load auth.json\n\n# Cookies\nplaywright-cli cookie-list\nplaywright-cli cookie-list --domain=example.com\nplaywright-cli cookie-get session_id\nplaywright-cli cookie-set session_id abc123\nplaywright-cli cookie-set session_id abc123 --domain=example.com --httpOnly --secure\nplaywright-cli cookie-delete session_id\nplaywright-cli cookie-clear\n\n# LocalStorage\nplaywright-cli localstorage-list\nplaywright-cli localstorage-get theme\nplaywright-cli localstorage-set theme dark\nplaywright-cli localstorage-delete theme\nplaywright-cli localstorage-clear\n\n# SessionStorage\nplaywright-cli sessionstorage-list\nplaywright-cli sessionstorage-get step\nplaywright-cli sessionstorage-set step 3\nplaywright-cli sessionstorage-delete step\nplaywright-cli sessionstorage-clear\n```\n\n### Network\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli route \"**/*.jpg\" --status=404\nplaywright-cli route \"https://api.example.com/**\" --body=''{\"mock\": true}''\nplaywright-cli route-list\nplaywright-cli unroute \"**/*.jpg\"\nplaywright-cli unroute\n```\n\n### DevTools\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli console\nplaywright-cli console warning\nplaywright-cli network\nplaywright-cli run-code \"async page => await page.context().grantPermissions([''geolocation''])\"\nplaywright-cli tracing-start\nplaywright-cli tracing-stop\nplaywright-cli video-start\nplaywright-cli video-stop video.webm\n```\n\n### Install\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli install --skills\nplaywright-cli install-browser\n```\n\n### Configuration\n```bash\n# Use specific browser when creating session\nplaywright-cli open --browser=chrome\nplaywright-cli open --browser=firefox\nplaywright-cli open --browser=webkit\nplaywright-cli open --browser=msedge\n# Connect to browser via extension\nplaywright-cli open --extension\n\n# Use persistent profile (by default profile is in-memory)\nplaywright-cli open --persistent\n# Use persistent profile with custom directory\nplaywright-cli open --profile=/path/to/profile\n\n# Start with config file\nplaywright-cli open --config=my-config.json\n\n# Close the browser\nplaywright-cli close\n# Delete user data for the default session\nplaywright-cli delete-data\n```\n\n### Browser Sessions\n\n```bash\n# create new browser session named \"mysession\" with persistent profile\nplaywright-cli -s=mysession open example.com --persistent\n# same with manually specified profile directory (use when requested explicitly)\nplaywright-cli -s=mysession open example.com --profile=/path/to/profile\nplaywright-cli -s=mysession click e6\nplaywright-cli -s=mysession close  # stop a named browser\nplaywright-cli -s=mysession delete-data  # delete user data for persistent session\n\nplaywright-cli list\n# Close all browsers\nplaywright-cli close-all\n# Forcefully kill all browser processes\nplaywright-cli kill-all\n```\n\n## Example: Form submission\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli open https://example.com/form\nplaywright-cli snapshot\n\nplaywright-cli fill e1 \"user@example.com\"\nplaywright-cli fill e2 \"password123\"\nplaywright-cli click e3\nplaywright-cli snapshot\nplaywright-cli close\n```\n\n## Example: Multi-tab workflow\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli open https://example.com\nplaywright-cli tab-new https://example.com/other\nplaywright-cli tab-list\nplaywright-cli tab-select 0\nplaywright-cli snapshot\nplaywright-cli close\n```\n\n## Example: Debugging with DevTools\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli open https://example.com\nplaywright-cli click e4\nplaywright-cli fill e7 \"test\"\nplaywright-cli console\nplaywright-cli network\nplaywright-cli close\n```\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli open https://example.com\nplaywright-cli tracing-start\nplaywright-cli click e4\nplaywright-cli fill e7 \"test\"\nplaywright-cli tracing-stop\nplaywright-cli close\n```\n\n## Specific tasks\n\n* **Request mocking** [references/request-mocking.md](references/request-mocking.md)\n* **Running Playwright code** [references/running-code.md](references/running-code.md)\n* **Browser session management** [references/session-management.md](references/session-management.md)\n* **Storage state (cookies, localStorage)** [references/storage-state.md](references/storage-state.md)\n* **Test generation** [references/test-generation.md](references/test-generation.md)\n* **Tracing** [references/tracing.md](references/tracing.md)\n* **Video recording** [references/video-recording.md](references/video-recording.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:12:00.771Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Automation Agents requiring seamless browser interaction and web page scraping capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要无缝浏览器交互和网页抓取功能的自动化代理。","ja":"自動化エージェントがブラウザの無邪気な相互作用とWebページのスクレイピング機能を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"自动화 에이전트가無障碍 브라우저 상호작용 및 웹 페이지 스크레이핑 기능을 필요로 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Automatización que requieren una interacción del navegador sin problemas y capacidades de extracción de páginas web.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''Automatisation nécessitant une interaction de navigateur sans problème et des capacités d''extraction de pages Web.","de":"Ideal für Automatisierungsagenten, die eine nahtlose Browser-Interaktion und Webseiten-Scraping-Funktionen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Automação que exigem interação de navegador sem problemas e capacidades de raspagem de páginas da web.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации, требующих бесшовного взаимодействия с браузером и возможностей скрапинга веб-страниц.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التutomation الذي يتطلب التفاعل السلس للمتصفح وقدرات حزمة صفحات الويب."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate browser interactions using commands like ''open'', ''goto'', and ''click'', facilitating web scraping and testing with protocols like HTTPS and tools like playwright-cli.","zh":"赋予代理使用诸如 ''open''、''goto'' 和 ''click'' 的命令来自动化浏览器交互，促进使用像 HTTPS 的协议和像 playwright-cli 的工具进行 Web 抓取和测试。","ja":"エージェントが ''open''、''goto''、''click'' などのコマンドを使用してブラウザの相互作用を自動化できるようにし、HTTPS のようなプロトコルや playwright-cli のようなツールを使用した Web スクレイピングやテストを促進します。","ko":"에이전트가 ''open'', ''goto'', ''click'' 등의 명령을 사용하여 브라우저 상호작용을 자동화 할 수 있도록 하여 HTTPS와 같은 프로토콜 및 playwright-cli와 같은 도구를 사용한 웹 스크레이핑 및 테스트를 촉진합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar interacciones del navegador utilizando comandos como ''open'', ''goto'' y ''click'', facilitando la extracción web y las pruebas con protocolos como HTTPS y herramientas como playwright-cli.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les interactions de navigateur en utilisant des commandes comme ''open'', ''goto'' et ''click'', facilitant le scraping Web et les tests avec des protocoles comme HTTPS et des outils comme playwright-cli.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Browser-Interaktionen mithilfe von Befehlen wie ''open'', ''goto'' und ''click'' zu automatisieren, wodurch Web-Scraping und Tests mit Protokollen wie HTTPS und Tools wie playwright-cli erleichtert werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar interações de navegador usando comandos como ''open'', ''goto'' e ''click'', facilitando a raspagem da web e os testes com protocolos como HTTPS e ferramentas como playwright-cli.","ru":"Позволяет агентам автоматизировать взаимодействие с браузером, используя команды типа ''open'', ''goto'' и ''click'', что облегчает веб-скрапинг и тестирование с использованием протоколов типа HTTPS и инструментов типа playwright-cli.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على توفير التفاعل التفاعلي للمتصفح باستخدام أوامر مثل ''open'' و ''goto'' و ''click'' ، مما يسهل حزمة الويب و الاختبار باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل HTTPS وأدوات مثل playwright-cli."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating web page interactions for testing purposes","Scraping data from web pages using playwright-cli commands","Generating screenshots of web pages for analysis"],"zh":["为测试目的自动化网页交互","使用 playwright-cli 命令从网页抓取数据","生成网页截图以进行分析"],"ja":["テスト目的の Web ページの相互作用を自動化する","playwright-cli コマンドを使用して Web ページからデータをスクレイピングする","分析のために Web ページのスクリーンショットを生成する"],"ko":["테스트 목적을 위한 웹 페이지 상호작용 자동화","playwright-cli 명령을 사용하여 웹 페이지에서 데이터 수집","분석을 위한 웹 페이지 스크린샷 생성"],"es":["Automatizar interacciones de página web para fines de prueba","Extraer datos de páginas web utilizando comandos de playwright-cli","Generar capturas de pantalla de páginas web para análisis"],"fr":["Automatiser les interactions de page Web à des fins de test","Extraire des données de pages Web en utilisant des commandes de playwright-cli","Générer des captures d''écran de pages Web pour analyse"],"de":["Automatisieren von Webseiten-Interaktionen für Testzwecke","Daten von Webseiten mithilfe von playwright-cli-Befehlen extrahieren","Erstellen von Screenshots von Webseiten für die Analyse"],"pt":["Automatizar interações de página da web para fins de teste","Raspar dados de páginas da web usando comandos playwright-cli","Gerar capturas de tela de páginas da web para análise"],"ru":["Автоматизация взаимодействия с веб-страницами для тестирования","Скрапинг данных из веб-страниц, используя команды playwright-cli","Генерация скриншотов веб-страниц для анализа"],"ar":["توفير التفاعل التفاعلي لصفحة الويب لأغراض الاختبار","حزمة البيانات من صفحات الويب باستخدام أوامر playwright-cli","إنشاء لقطات شاشة لصفحات الويب للتحليل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires playwright-cli installation","Limited to browser automation tasks"],"zh":["需要安装 playwright-cli","仅限于浏览器自动化任务"],"ja":["playwright-cli のインストールが必要","ブラウザの自動化タスクのみに限定される"],"ko":["playwright-cli 설치가 필요","브라우저 자동화 작업만 제한"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de playwright-cli","Limitado a tareas de automatización del navegador"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de playwright-cli","Limité aux tâches d''automatisation de navigateur"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation von playwright-cli","Begrenzt auf Browser-Automatisierungsaufgaben"],"pt":["Exige instalação do playwright-cli","Limitado a tarefas de automação do navegador"],"ru":["Требует установки playwright-cli","Ограничен задачами автоматизации браузера"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت playwright-cli","محدود بمهام 자동 من المتصفح"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"d3d4ae2a282617c0c3894b2f0425fbfc9c661599cfbb64b6c075747a341cfdd9","qualityScore":39}');
