ibilité avec HuggingFace et Civitai"],"de":["Modellidentifizierung und URL-Download","Erstellung von YAML-Dateien für Modellquellen","Validierung von YAML-Schemata","Dateistruktur im sources/-Verzeichnis","Kompatibilität mit HuggingFace und Civitai"],"pt":["Criação de arquivos YAML para fontes de modelos","Validação de esquemas YAML","Gerenciamento de fontes de modelos padrão","Download de URLs de modelos","Integração com plataformas como HuggingFace e Civitai"],"ru":["Создание файлов YAML для источников моделей","Проверка схем YAML","Управление источниками моделей по умолчанию","Загрузка URL моделей","Интеграция с платформами như HuggingFace и Civitai"],"ar":["إنشاء ملفات YAML لمصادر النماذج","التحقق من مخططات YAML","إدارة مصادر النماذج الافتراضية","تنزيل URLs النماذج","التكامل مع منصات مثل HuggingFace و Civitai"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use comfydl-source-manager","comfydl-source-manager setup guide","comfydl-source-manager alternative","comfydl-source-manager vs other AI agent skills","comfydl-source-manager install","what is comfydl-source-manager","comfydl-source-manager YAML workflow","comfydl-source-manager model source management","comfydl-source-manager AI agent integration"],"zh":["ComfyDL Source Manager","AI 工具","模型源管理","HuggingFace","Civitai","YAML 模式","sources 目录","模型下载","AI开发"],"ja":["ComfyDL Source Manager","AI エージェント","モデルソース管理","HuggingFace","Civitai","YAML スキーマ","sources ディレクトリ","モデルダウンロード","AI開発"],"ko":["ComfyDL Source Manager","AI 에이전트","모델 소스 관리","HuggingFace","Civitai","YAML 스키마","sources 디렉토리","모델 다운로드","AI 개발"],"es":["comfydl-source-manager","AI Agentes","creación de fuentes de modelos","gestión de fuentes de modelos","YAML schema","HuggingFace","Civitai","desarrollo de IA"],"fr":["comfydl-source-manager","Outils d''IA","création de sources de modèles","gestion de sources de modèles","schéma YAML","HuggingFace","Civitai","développement d''IA"],"de":["comfydl-source-manager","KI-Tool","Erstellung von Modellquellen","Verwaltung von Modellquellen","YAML-Schema","HuggingFace","Civitai","KI-Entwicklung"],"pt":["ComfyDL Source Manager","gerenciamento de fontes de modelos","YAML","validação de esquemas","download de URLs","HuggingFace","Civitai","ferramentas de IA","desenvolvimento de IA"],"ru":["ComfyDL Source Manager","управление источниками моделей","YAML","проверка схем","загрузка URL","HuggingFace","Civitai","ИИ инструменты","разработка ИИ"],"ar":["ComfyDL Source Manager","إدارة مصادر النماذج","YAML","التحقق من مخططات","تنزيل URLs","HuggingFace","Civitai","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"ShinChven","repo":"comfydl-sources","repoPath":"ShinChven/comfydl-sources","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.594Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"comfydl-source-manager","description":"Manage and create default model source YAML files for the comfydl package. Use when requested to add new models, update existing ones, or organize the sources/ directory.","bodyPreview":"# ComfyDL Source Manager\n\nThis skill guides the creation and management of default model sources bundled with `comfydl`.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1.  **Identify Model**: Determine the model name and its download URLs (HuggingFace, Civitai, etc.).\n2.  **Create YAML**: Add a new file to `sources/<name>.yaml`.\n3.  **Validate**: Ensure the YAML follows the required schema.\n\n## File Structure\n\nAll source files MUST be in the `sources/` directory.\n\n## YAML Schema\n\n```yaml\ndescription: \"Brief description of the m","body":"# ComfyDL Source Manager\n\nThis skill guides the creation and management of default model sources bundled with `comfydl`.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1.  **Identify Model**: Determine the model name and its download URLs (HuggingFace, Civitai, etc.).\n2.  **Create YAML**: Add a new file to `sources/<name>.yaml`.\n3.  **Validate**: Ensure the YAML follows the required schema.\n\n## File Structure\n\nAll source files MUST be in the `sources/` directory.\n\n## YAML Schema\n\n```yaml\ndescription: \"Brief description of the model set\"\nsource: \"URL to the model''s homepage or documentation (optional)\"\ndownloads:\n  - url: \"https://huggingface.co/...\"\n    dest: \"models/checkpoints/filename.safetensors\"\n  - url: \"https://civitai.com/api/download/models/ID\"\n    dest: \"models/loras/filename.safetensors\"\n```\n\n### Constraints\n- **Filename**: Short, descriptive, lowercase (e.g., `realvis.yaml`). The filename becomes the `comfydl` subcommand.\n- **Destinations**: Use relative paths from the ComfyUI root (e.g., `models/checkpoints/`, `models/loras/`, `models/embeddings/`, `models/vae/`).\n- **Civitai Links**: MUST use the API link format `https://civitai.com/api/download/models/ID`. DO NOT include API tokens.\n- **Versions**: Create separate files for different model sizes/variants if they are distinct \"recipes\".\n\n## Testing\nNo explicit testing command is required for source files.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:12:04.629Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agent Developers needing streamlined model source management for comfydl.","zh":"非常适合需要为comfydl流畅管理模型源的AI代理开发人员","ja":"comfydlのモデルソース管理を簡素化する必要があるAIエージェント開発者に最適","ko":"comfydl을 위한 모델 소스 관리를 간소화해야 하는 AI 에이전트 개발자에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para Desarrolladores de Agentes de IA que necesitan una gestión de fuentes de modelo simplificada para comfydl.","fr":"Parfait pour les Développeurs d''Agents d''IA ayant besoin d''une gestion de sources de modèle simplifiée pour comfydl.","de":"Perfekt für AI-Agent-Entwickler, die eine vereinfachte Modellquellenverwaltung für comfydl benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para desenvolvedores de Agentes de IA que necessitam de gerenciamento de fontes de modelo simplificado para comfydl.","ru":"Идеально для разработчиков агентов ИИ, которым требуется упрощенное управление источниками моделей для comfydl.","ar":"مثالي لمطوري وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة مصادر نموذجية مبسطة لcomfydl."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to efficiently create and manage default model sources using YAML files, ensuring schema validation and compatibility with HuggingFace and Civitai models.","zh":"赋予代理高效创建和管理默认模型源的能力，使用YAML文件，确保与HuggingFace和Civitai模型的模式验证和兼容性","ja":"エージェントがYAMLファイルを使用してデフォルトのモデルソースを作成および管理することを可能にし、HuggingFaceおよびCivitaiモデルとのスキーマ検証および互換性を確保する","ko":"에이전트가 YAML 파일을 사용하여 기본 모델 소스를 효율적으로 생성하고 관리할 수 있도록 하며, HuggingFace 및 Civitai 모델과 스키마 검증 및 호환성을 보장","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear y gestionar fuentes de modelo predeterminadas de manera eficiente utilizando archivos YAML, garantizando la validación de esquemas y la compatibilidad con los modelos de HuggingFace y Civitai.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et de gérer des sources de modèle par défaut de manière efficace en utilisant des fichiers YAML, en garantissant la validation des schémas et la compatibilité avec les modèles HuggingFace et Civitai.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Standardmodellquellen effizient zu erstellen und zu verwalten, indem YAML-Dateien verwendet werden, wodurch die Schemavalidierung und die Kompatibilität mit HuggingFace- und Civitai-Modellen sichergestellt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar e gerenciar fontes de modelo padrão de forma eficiente usando arquivos YAML, garantindo validação de esquema e compatibilidade com modelos HuggingFace e Civitai.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью эффективно создавать и управлять исходными кодами моделей по умолчанию, используя файлы YAML, обеспечивая проверку схемы и совместимость с моделями HuggingFace и Civitai.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء وإدارة مصادر نموذجية افتراضية بفعالية باستخدام ملفات YAML، مما يضمن التحقق من مخطط ومتوافق مع نماذج HuggingFace وCivitai."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating model source identification","Generating valid YAML files for comfydl","Validating schema for model sources"],"zh":["自动化模型源识别","为comfydl生成有效的YAML文件","验证模型源的模式"],"ja":["モデルソースの自動識別","comfydl用の有効なYAMLファイルの生成","モデルソースのスキーマの検証"],"ko":[" 모델 소스 식별 자동화","comfydl을 위한有效한 YAML 파일 생성"," 모델 소스 스키마 검증"],"es":["Automatización de la identificación de fuentes de modelo","Generación de archivos YAML válidos para comfydl","Validación de esquemas para fuentes de modelo"],"fr":["Automatisation de l''identification des sources de modèle","Génération de fichiers YAML valides pour comfydl","Validation des schémas pour les sources de modèle"],"de":["Automatisierung der Modellquellenidentifizierung","Erzeugung gültiger YAML-Dateien für comfydl","Validierung von Schemata für Modellquellen"],"pt":["Automatizar a identificação de fontes de modelo","Gerar arquivos YAML válidos para comfydl","Validar esquema para fontes de modelo"],"ru":["Автоматизировать определение источников модели","Генерировать действительные файлы YAML для comfydl","Проверять схему для источников модели"],"ar":["أتمتة تحديد مصادر النموذج","генерировать ملفات YAML صالحة لcomfydl"," التحقق من مخطط لمصادر النموذج"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires comfydl installation","YAML files must follow specific schema","Limited to models from supported sources like HuggingFace and Civitai"],"zh":["需要安装comfydl","YAML文件必须遵循特定的模式","仅限于来自HuggingFace和Civitai等支持的源的模型"],"ja":["comfydlのインストールが必要","YAMLファイルは特定のスキーマに従わなければならない","HuggingFaceおよびCivitaiなどのサポートされているソースからのモデルに限られる"],"ko":["comfydl 설치가 필요","YAML 파일은 특정 스키마를 따라야 함","HuggingFace 및 Civitai와 같은 지원되는 소스에서 제공되는 모델로 제한"],"es":["Requiere instalación de comfydl","Los archivos YAML deben seguir un esquema específico","Limitado a modelos de fuentes compatibles como HuggingFace y Civitai"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de comfydl","Les fichiers YAML doivent suivre un schéma spécifique","Limité aux modèles de sources prises en charge comme HuggingFace et Civitai"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation von comfydl","YAML-Dateien müssen einem bestimmten Schema folgen","Begrenzt auf Modelle von unterstützten Quellen wie HuggingFace und Civitai"],"pt":["Requer instalação do comfydl","Arquivos YAML devem seguir esquema específico","Limitado a modelos de fontes compatíveis como HuggingFace e Civitai"],"ru":["Требует установки comfydl","Файлы YAML должны следовать определенному схеме","Ограничен моделями из поддерживаемых источников, таких как HuggingFace и Civitai"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت comfydl","يجب أن تتبع ملفات YAML مخططًا محددًا","محدود بنماذج من مصادر مدعومة مثل HuggingFace وCivitai"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"c95129e2d7b7c0e6ad39f4ae1be90d7d428d1248f73caa91f1839088537f1136","qualityScore":39}');
