INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('ShinChven/comfydl-sources/comfydl-source-manager', 'comfydl-source-manager', 'ShinChven', 'comfydl-sources', 'community', 'comfydl-source-manager ShinChven comfydl-sources community The comfydl-source-manager skill facilitates the creation and management of default model sources for comfydl, benefiting AI agent developers. It guides the workflow of identifying models, creating YAML files, and validating their schema. ComfyDL Source Manager 是一个指导创建和管理默认模型源的工具，支持 HuggingFace 和 Civitai 等平台 ComfyDL Source Manager は、デフォルトモデルソースの作成と管理を支援するツールで、HuggingFace や Civitai などのプラットフォームをサポートしています ComfyDL Source Manager는 기본 모델 소스의 생성 및 관리를 지원하는 도구로 HuggingFace 및 Civitaiなどの 플랫폼을 지원합니다 El comfydl-source-manager es una habilidad que facilita la creación y gestión de fuentes de modelos predeterminadas para comfydl. Le comfydl-source-manager est une compétence qui facilite la création et la gestion de sources de modèles par défaut pour comfydl. Der comfydl-source-manager ist eine Fähigkeit, die die Erstellung und Verwaltung von vorkonfigurierten Modellquellen für comfydl erleichtert. O ComfyDL Source Manager é uma ferramenta para criar e gerenciar fontes de modelos padrão. Ele permite a criação de arquivos YAML e a validação de esquemas. ComfyDL Source Manager - это инструмент для создания и управления источниками моделей по умолчанию. Он позволяет создавать файлы YAML и проверять схемы. ComfyDL Source Manager هو أداة لإنشاء وإدارة مصادر النماذج الافتراضية. يسمح بإنشاء ملفات YAML و التحقق من مخططات البيانات how to use comfydl-source-manager comfydl-source-manager setup guide comfydl-source-manager alternative comfydl-source-manager vs other AI agent skills comfydl-source-manager install what is comfydl-source-manager comfydl-source-manager YAML workflow comfydl-source-manager model source management comfydl-source-manager AI agent integration ComfyDL Source Manager AI 工具 模型源管理 HuggingFace Civitai YAML 模式 sources 目录 模型下载 AI开发 Creates and manages YAML files for model sources in the sources/ directory Validates YAML files against a required schema for consistency Supports model sources from HuggingFace and Civitai Guides the workflow of identifying models and their download URLs Ensures seamless integration with comfydl through standardized file structure comfydl-source-manager is a skill that guides the creation and management of default model sources bundled with comfydl, utilizing YAML files and a specific schema for validation.');
