INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('NagasakaH/devcontainer/e2e', 'e2e', 'NagasakaH', 'devcontainer', 'community', 'e2e NagasakaH devcontainer community The e2e skill generates, maintains, and executes end-to-end tests for various programming languages, including TypeScript, JavaScript, Python, and C#. It benefits developers by automating testing workflows. E2E测试生成工具是一种自动化测试工具，支持多种语言，包括TypeScript、JavaScript、Python和C# E2Eテスト生成（E2E）は、TypeScript、JavaScript、Python、C#などの言語をサポートする自動テストツールです E2E 테스트 생성 도구는 TypeScript, JavaScript, Python, C# 등의 언어를 지원하는 자동 테스트 도구입니다 e2e es una herramienta para la gestión de plantillas de devcontainer, que facilita la creación y mantenimiento de pruebas end-to-end e2e est un outil de gestion de modèles de devcontainer, qui facilite la création et la maintenance de tests de bout en bout e2e ist ein Tool für die Verwaltung von Devcontainer-Vorlagen, das die Erstellung und Wartung von End-to-End-Tests erleichtert O agente e2e é uma ferramenta para gerar e manter testes de ponta a ponta em projetos de desenvolvimento. Suporta TypeScript, JavaScript, Python e C# ИИ Агент e2e - это инструмент для генерации и поддержки тестирования от начала до конца в проектах разработки. Поддерживает TypeScript, JavaScript, Python и C# العامل الذكي e2e هو أداة لتوليد وضبط اختبارات النهاية إلى النهاية في مشاريع التطوير. يدعم لغات TypeScript و JavaScript و Python و C# e2e testing end-to-end testing setup guide how to use e2e e2e vs Cypress e2e install e2e alternative what is e2e e2e for Python e2e for JavaScript e2e setup guide E2E测试生成工具 自动化测试 TypeScript JavaScript Python C# Playwright Cypress Selenium CI/CD Supports end-to-end testing for TypeScript and JavaScript using Playwright and Cypress Automates testing for Python using Playwright for Python and Selenium Enables end-to-end testing for C# using Playwright for .NET and Selenium Automatically detects project language and uses appropriate test frameworks and commands Provides detailed documentation for test frameworks, including reference/typescript/frameworks.md and reference/python/frameworks.md e2e is an end-to-end testing skill that automates test generation, maintenance, and execution for multiple programming languages using frameworks like Playwright and Cypress.');
